    {
      "tr": "Çözümün tamamı:\n\n**main.py**\n\n```python\nfrom fastapi import FastAPI, Query\n\napp = FastAPI()\n\n\n@app.get(\"/tags\")\ndef tags(tag: list[str] = Query(default=[])):\n    return {\"tags\": sorted(tag), \"count\": len(tag)}\n```",
      "en": "The full solution:\n\n**main.py**\n\n```python\nfrom fastapi import FastAPI, Query\n\napp = FastAPI()\n\n\n@app.get(\"/tags\")\ndef tags(tag: list[str] = Query(default=[])):\n    return {\"tags\": sorted(tag), \"count\": len(tag)}\n```"
    }
  ],
  "checks": [
